  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15.25 ounce) package yellow cake mix",
    "1 (11 ounce) can mandarin oranges, juice reserved",
    "4 large eggs",
    "0.25 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 (16 ounce) package frozen whipped topping, thawed",
    "1 (15 ounce) can crushed pineapple, drained",
    "1 (3.5 ounce) package instant vanilla pudding mix"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VPDMMGBOq4MVif4YmhLySpRH6EI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8043-pig-pickin-cake-VAT-step-01-2368fbfc47334c8fb21782c0c251553a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8043/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare the cake: Mix together cake mix, mandarin oranges with juice, eggs, and oil. Pour batter into three greased and floured 8-inch round pans. Layers will be thin.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eZ6iOQ6b9sDYPG2tUat54ge_k-U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8043-pig-pickin-cake-VAT-step-02-bec33909a8554abbba7322c36722eb63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8043/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of cake comes out clean, 25 to 30 minutes. Cool layers on wire racks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o2T1NJmlV9JmX0kFBD74dGGguVY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8043-pig-pickin-cake-VAT-step-03-4f1eace65e894cba8399f6a4158c5d5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8043/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the frosting: Mix together whipped topping, crushed pineapple, and instant pudding mix.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WBNXRWsQL5b0nOnAyoMZS3-qIqQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8043-pig-pickin-cake-VAT-step-04-9a067c408aea4effa94a1604683b7d68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8043/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting onto the cooled cake layers. Stack layers; frost top and sides. Refrigerate until ready to eat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bRv6X4SfNjQHQ7G-nJpOQ49Xbxc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8043-pig-pickin-cake-VAT-step-05-af2b9dfbffad4d219e6f2ab2a005431a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8043/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and enjoy!",
